## `tsconfig.json`

```json
{
  "compilerOptions": {
    "strict": true,
    "target": "ES2022",
    "module": "CommonJS",
    "moduleResolution": "Node",
    "esModuleInterop": true,
    "skipLibCheck": true,
    "outDir": "dist"
  },
  "include": [
    "*.ts"
  ]
