```

For the Kubernetes service account, annotate it with the exported role ARN:

```yaml
apiVersion: v1
kind: ServiceAccount
metadata:
  name: webapp
  namespace: webapp
  annotations:
    eks.amazonaws.com/role-arn: <serviceAccountRoleArn>
```

Dev and prod remain independently deployable because each Pulumi stack has separate configuration and state. The component also uses exact bucket ARNs in its IAM policies rather than wildcard resources or actions.
